{#
  Who has opened the group since this post was published — the content of
  the dialog the "vu par N" line opens (public/assets/js/groups.js), shown
  to the post's own author only (Controller\PostController::seenBy()).

  Names, plain and escaped. Never a time: "seen" here is derived from when
  somebody last opened the group, and dressing that up as a per-message
  timestamp would claim a precision the data does not have.
#}
{% if names is empty %}
    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">Personne n'a encore ouvert le groupe depuis votre message.</p>
{% else %}
    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
        {% for name in names %}
            <li class="mb-1">{{ name }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
{% endif %}
